'''Japan''' is the 7th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Hippoe]] is introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, the [[Cat Capsule]] feature will be unlocked and the player will receive a free [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]]. After clearing the stage in Chapter 2, [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]]. For [[The Battle Cats POP!]], the [[Treasure|Treasure Menu]], [[Cat Base Menu|Equip Menu]], [[Battle Items|Item Shop]], and Wireless PVP are unlocked. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], clearing this stage unlocks [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]], [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]], [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargod Vajiras]], and [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] banners.

