==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
By now, you should have saved all your XP up until now to level your [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] as high as possible, maybe to level 10 if you got all superior treasures up to this point, which is highly recommended.

The enemies that appear before the boss fight should be relatively easily to deal with by now, making it possible to stall with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] long enough to attain a full wallet and level 8 [[Worker Cat]]. When Those Guys appear, fire the [[Cat Cannon]] and spawn at least two Cats. When your Worker Cat reaches max level, you can start sending out everything but [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]].

Hippoe hits quite hard compared to the previous enemies and is able to harm multiple units at once. Rather than trying to deal melee damage with Axe Cats, use [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] to protect and stack Gross Cats, whose long range enables them to land several hits before Hippoe reaches them.

Though it may sound counterproductive, letting Hippoe get close to the [[Cat Base]] and then firing the [[Cat Cannon]] will buy more time for Gross Cat to attack them before more peons can get in the way; this strategy will come into play many more times throughout the game.

Another strategy for Chapter 1 is to keep spamming Basic Cats until you can afford a Worker Cat upgrade. When Hippoe spawns, start deploying Tank Cats instead. Use your Cat Cannon when Those Guys start overwhelming you.

For Chapters 2 and 3 - Use Tank Cat to stall the enemies and upgrade your Worker Cat to max level. Then spawn your stronger units, such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], etc.

