==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Fukuoka Prefecture'''.
*Japan's base is a [[wikipedia:Maiko|''maiko'']] (apprentice geisha) in front of [[wikipedia:Kinkaku-ji|Kinkaku-ji]], a Zen Buddhist temple and popular tourist attraction.
**Japan's base originally belonged to [[Egypt (Empire of Cats)|Kyoto Prefecture]], the 20th stage of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], making it one of the few bases from the Japanese version of [[Empire of Cats]] to appear at all in [[Empire of Cats|BCEN]].
***It is also one of the only two bases in the English version of Empire of Cats to not be from [[Kumanchu Royale]], the other being the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]]'s base.
*Fukuoka Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Dazaifu Tenmangū|Dazaifu Tenmangū]], one of Japan's most important Shinto shrines.

